caption: Clerics

Gods can also empower Ritual Magic used by clerics, who need not be paid for unless they are also Champions, but what colleges they can access are limited by the domain of the God. The majority of clergy are Clerics, who have no greater ability to contact their god than any other worshipper, and use the Ritual Magic granted by their pantheon to spread knowledge of it and encourage worship.
